                    Rusk had a conversation along these lines
                    on August 13 with Ambassador Sir Patrick Dean. (Telegram 834 to London, August
                    13; National Archives and Records Administration, RG 59, Central Files 1964–66, POL
                    PAK-US)</p>
            </note>
